    fix(build): DeployXboxLocal robocopy drops the timestamp filter [PLAN-XBOXUWP FIX-XKBDPANEL-001]
    
    The /S /XO shape skipped older-but-different files, so switching deploy configurations left a Frankenbuild layout (Release head over newer Debug core libs; EMU sank to 26%). The refresh now deterministically mirrors whatever was just built. Gate: Category=Xbox 498/498.
    
